  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Every day there may or may not be an anomaly. When you stand up this is
    already decided and nothing you do will change if the day has an anomaly or not.


    The
    anomalies are things that should not happen "in the real world" of the game.
    It''s not going to be "Were there 3 or 4 pencils here last time?". But some might
    be a bit hard to spot, while others will be impossible to miss.


    The Manager
    himself is not an anomaly.


    There''s only ever one anomaly active in a single
    day. But a single anomaly can occur at multiple locations at once.


    It is
    expected to be sent back to Monday several times. This doesn''t mean the game
    isn''t progressing.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
