  m_text: 'This ship is sinking, and the boss'' only solution is to assign overtime.



    <color=#c8024f>Avoid
    boss</color>



    If everything looks <color=#c8024f>normal</color> leave through
    the front using the <color=#c8024f>elevator</color>.



    If something seems
    <color=#c8024f>out of the ordinary</color>, leave through the  <color=#c8024f>fire
    escape</color> in the back.



    Hopefully we''ll make it to <color=#c8024f>Sunday</color>
    and escape to our D''n''D session.


    New to Anomaly Hunt games? Please read
    the "HELP!" too.'
