    - baseColor: {fileID: 21300000, guid: d4045534255eefa44a0c852f95b85618, type: 3}
      secondColor: {fileID: 0}
      thirdColor: {fileID: 0}
  - description: Keep your distance If the manager is patrolling around the office.
    illustrations:
    - baseColor: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a1989e41bd4907544919a9bf1c41e9b9, type: 3}
      secondColor: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 32b95da83c98a6a4cbffb5c3dc5d0195, type: 3}
      thirdColor: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 89788e013c9e91644bd7bd444e52bd10, type: 3}
  - description: If nothing seemed out of the ordinary in any of the rooms, take
      the elevator
    illustrations:
    - baseColor: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 845320eacaadbd84d856c5d406a7955d, type: 3}
      secondColor: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 755e69ea84fcba64184cc6a034f71c0e, type: 3}
      thirdColor: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ca59afec7009225499694fa119aa1c79, type: 3}
  - description: If something isn't quite like it should be, stop searching at once
      and run for the fire escape!!!
    illustrations:
    - baseColor: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f80689a7297793848b25daaff7dc891c, type: 3}
      secondColor: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 0ef92908e977cda4690ee529f187de06, type: 3}
